        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a mysterious village plagued by werewolves… but this time, it’s all happening online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Wolvenrise, players join a virtual room where everyone is secretly assigned a role:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Villagers try to find and eliminate the werewolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Werewolves secretly hunt the villagers at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Special roles like Fool, Spy, and Doctor to spice up the strategy. (more roles will be released)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it works:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Each “night,” the werewolves secretly pick a victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    During the “day,” everyone debates, accuses, and votes to eliminate someone — hopefully a werewolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    The game continues until either the villagers wipe out the wolves or the wolves take over the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Play with friends or strangers anywhere in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Built-in chat (sometimes even voice) to discuss and bluff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Automatic role assignment and turn management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Tons of roles, custom rules, and fun themes to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the same thrilling, paranoid, hilarious experience of the classic card game — but without needing to pass out cards or argue over who’s “closing their eyes properly.”</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a mysterious village plagued by werewolves… but this time, it’s all happening online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Wolvenrise, players join a virtual room where everyone is secretly assigned a role:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Villagers try to find and eliminate the werewolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Werewolves secretly hunt the villagers at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Special roles like Fool, Spy, and Doctor to spice up the strategy. (more roles will be released)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it works:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Each “night,” the werewolves secretly pick a victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    During the “day,” everyone debates, accuses, and votes to eliminate someone — hopefully a werewolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    The game continues until either the villagers wipe out the wolves or the wolves take over the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Play with friends or strangers anywhere in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Built-in chat (sometimes even voice) to discuss and bluff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Automatic role assignment and turn management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    •    Tons of roles, custom rules, and fun themes to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the same thrilling, paranoid, hilarious experience of the classic card game — but without needing to pass out cards or argue over who’s “closing their eyes properly.”</p>",
        "short_description": "The game takes place in a dark, medieval-inspired village shrouded in air of suspense and mistrust. The atmospheric setting immerses players in a high-stakes battle of survival, where every decision and accusation can mean the difference between victory and defeat.",
